Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Original Work, Story & Character Design\NAkira Toriyama (Shueisha "Jump comics")
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hee, hee hee!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Time to adventure!\NYou'll be hooked for sure!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Demon Realm is full of mystery{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}DAIMA wonderland{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Whoopsie daisy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even when your heart shrinks\NAnd you feel low{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.79,0:00:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dreams are everywhere\NDon't worry about it{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Never give up{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:01:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Here comes a New Story{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thousands of jabs and silly jokes{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They're waitin' for you{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.11,0:01:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Jaan! Jaka jaan!\NThe fanfare of courage{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No-holds-barred battles\NThe excitement ain't stoppin'{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey Shenron, grant my wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wanna meet\NSomeone amazin' again tomorrow{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:46.85,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,THIEVES
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's camp somewhere\Nthat's difficult to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:02:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Let me take a bath for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me sleep in a bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we have Goku wear a bear hat,\Nno one will know it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See? It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.38,0:02:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.69,0:02:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That red stick stands out.\NYou should leave it in the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's keep the Dragon Ball in a sack, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll put it away for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oof.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That should take care of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.11,0:03:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For caution's sake,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,we should all stay in\Na large room together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll have room service bring meals, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll wait on the sofa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Glorio's got quite a lot of money,\Ndoesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't your father, King Kadan,\Nsponsoring him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dad's stingy, so I doubt he'd pay anything\Nunless we defeat King Gomah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't do that! Keep your hat on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This hat makes my head itch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who cares?! Just keep it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Honestly!\N-Hey. See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:04:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That spikey-haired kid…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the kid they say beat the Tamagami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That round bag…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must be the Dragon Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll fetch a hefty price.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel refreshed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku, you should take a bath, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop complaining!\NYou're sweaty from all that fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is an order! Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.18,0:04:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.65,0:04:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your change of clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.27,0:04:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't bring any.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh very well. I'll lend you some of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not into women's undies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't mean my undergarments!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That felt great! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.27,0:05:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gettin' used to the food here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.91,0:05:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How very rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.63,0:05:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Want me to beat him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They stole the Dragon Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh come on! After we went to\Nall that trouble to get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was working with\Nthe werewolf downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.59,0:06:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So it was a planned heist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.01,0:06:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave things to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I planted a tracker on it\Nearlier just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.15,0:06:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?! Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That worked out well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. They'd never guess\Nthat we'd escape straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.13,0:07:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, let me take a look at that!\NThe Dragon Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't it pointless\Nunless you get all three?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's true.\NBut even one is worth plenty as…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give back the Dragon Ball, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoops!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm takin' this back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You did well, Panzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:08:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. G'night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.79,0:09:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was that your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be meeting up with your friends\Nnear Warp-sama tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are your friends powerful, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You bet. Those two are pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Still, we can't be too careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we leave the hotel and camp out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! That's such a waste!\NThis place is pretty expensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll keep watch,\Nso you guys go sleep in your beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got a lot of rest on the plane anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's take him up on his offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Goku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure! I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When did he fall asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, now.\NIt appears that nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thankfully no one\Nstole our plane this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt anyone would try to steal\Na Gendarmerie plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long until we get to Warp-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We should reach it\Nwithin the day with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's our plane?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, looks like they got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.43,0:11:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.14,0:11:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was a plane we stole,\Nbut someone stole it from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.39,0:11:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was probably the guys\Nyou beat up last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you watch where you're walking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh crud!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blast it! Those scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We should contact the princess\Nto pick us up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.95,0:12:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess we wait here until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man… This'll be boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we play the Zombie Game?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a zombie forest nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoever eliminates the most zombies wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you get bitten and turn into a zombie,\Nyou're disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.09,0:12:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pass, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.01,0:12:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That eye thing attached to your belt…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! Whoa! It just moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I found a living eye in the mountains\Na long time ago and put it on my belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eww! That's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it cool and impressive?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.34,0:13:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Continue to gather information.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, the ones on Earth we turned\Ninto children entered the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.52,0:13:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?! Why are they here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To rescue that Namek kid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure, but it appears they're after\Nthe Dragon Balls of this Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Dragon Balls?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what they're after,\Nbut that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.21,0:14:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They already obtained the\NThird Demon World Dragon Ball yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! B-But we turned them into children!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.39,0:14:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Yesterday"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What have you been doing up to now?!\NYou idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forgive me, Sire! It appears\Nthe Gendarmerie underestimated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're telling me that\Nthey defeated a Tamagami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At the moment, we believe they're after\Nthe Second Demon World Dragon…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,…Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then hurry up and do something about them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew my first wish\Nshould have been for the Third Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kakarot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.29,0:15:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're late, Kakarot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We heard you had your plane stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We had such an ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the princess, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Panzy. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.51,0:15:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Bulma.\NThis is Vegeta and this is Piccolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! You're a Namek!\NI've never seen one before!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.69,0:15:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Where's Kibito-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.60,0:15:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's looking after the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.57,0:15:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's why there's only three of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We hear you got a Demon Realm Dragon Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. One of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and let us on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.95,0:15:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm bored of this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:16:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be ridiculous.\NOur plane doesn't have the space.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're supposed to\Ngive us a ride, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can fit if you just\Nremove your luggage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.51,0:16:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't remove our rations and tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll ask Dad to see if he can get you\Nanother plane, so hold on a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we're gatherin' Dragon Balls,\Nso we'll go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Apologies. We're in a bit of a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're kidding…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.62,0:16:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys can go on ahead and\Ndefeat that King Gomah guy if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a minute! Isn't that a little cold?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We should have brought Kibito,\Nsince he can teleport.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Care to repeat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Well, see you later!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That little rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like he's obsessed with fighting\Nthose Tamagami things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a bad habit of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.65,0:17:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we play the Zombie Game\Nuntil a plane arrives?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll pay for what you did yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We ain't gonna just let\Nsome kid make fools of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So we brought some scary friends\Nfor a little payback!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, the Majin who started trouble\Nat the bar last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just a simple guide,\Nso I'll be eating snacks over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you the ones who stole our plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one who hurt us!\NOf course we did!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too late to cry\Nand beg for forgiveness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.04,0:18:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was just looking to blow off some steam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.39,0:19:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You dirty runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.81,0:19:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blast it!\NThat didn't even serve to waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow. That was really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:20:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I only got to eat two potato chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.40,0:20:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give back our plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yessir. W-We hid it nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man. What a terrible place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I shouldn't have let\Nmy curiosity bring me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't it look about ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.47,0:20:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.47,0:20:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I used to have enough Saibaimen seeds\NI could sell them to outsiders,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and now I only have two left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.11,0:20:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Things might not work out,\Nso lets start with just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't trust me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you said Majin Buu\Nwas just a fluke, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.16,0:20:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plant this one seed, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.83,0:21:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't plant it too deep.\NOnly about five centimeters down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.01,0:21:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll increase the amount of\NMajin Buu's essence,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.43,0:21:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but we won't be able to control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.89,0:21:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.31,0:21:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.55,0:21:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.14,0:21:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Using a Saibaiman as a base,\Nwe used various monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and as a finisher, the essence of\NMajin Buu to create this new Majin…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Majin Kuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.66,0:22:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now let's try it out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.25,0:22:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Defeat Tamagami Number One…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.00,0:22:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and get the Dragon Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.46,0:22:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Starting with a Tamagami?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.97,0:22:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless he's at least that strong,\Nthere's no point in making him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.60,0:22:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Holding out my hand{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Up to the sky{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The moment is ours{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Make a miracle happen{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.83,0:23:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Like a bird with open wings we fly{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.08,0:23:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Picking up{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Those pieces of hope{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There's no giving up{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.77,0:23:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Go as far as we can{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.10,0:23:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I got you by my side{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.73,0:23:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Run, run, run{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.82,0:23:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over the mountain we go{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.41,0:23:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I hear it always\NYour voice in my heart{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.24,0:23:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"You know that we're never alone"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:45.50,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,OCEAN
